{"4365920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buccaneer's Booty", "steam_appid": 4365920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a charming pirate puzzle adventure where brains matter more than brawn.<br>In this cute Sokoban-style game, your goal is to bury all the treasures on each island using logic, positioning, and a bit of pirate ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/421a59dc31962099b767a19bb3bdcf6b.poster.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/421a59dc31962099b767a19bb3bdcf6b.webm?t=1783601946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/421a59dc31962099b767a19bb3bdcf6b.mp4?t=1783601946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>40 paradise islands</strong>, you’ll push, destroy, sink, and bury objects to solve increasingly clever puzzles. Each island introduces new spatial challenges, mechanics, and terrain interactions that put your planning skills and creativity to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can interact with a variety of objects to solve each puzzle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push <strong>boxes, treasure chests, totems, snowmen, and cannons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy boxes</strong> by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing them into the water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pushing them against sharp rocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blowing them up with cannons</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/5dd34061d770a0cd5d4f3a6d348ad834.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy totems, snowmen, and cannons</strong> by dropping them into the water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place <strong>boxes into pits</strong> to create walkable paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk freely across <strong>bridges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage <strong>fragile bridges</strong>, which can only support limited movement<br>(Dragging boxes across them also consumes durability)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/1bcfb010e13e22fe66ea1d33582076ce.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environments &amp; Terrain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island is built using different terrain types that affect movement and strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sand</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grass</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/0a500efc2237ca7bd71cc19e50d1287b.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice</strong> – where objects slide until they hit something, adding an extra layer of challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/ceacb2fea99e3d74bd0f2966f13eb730.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pirate-themed Sokoban puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique islands to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple interactive objects with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental mechanics that reward careful planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, challenging to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for puzzle lovers who enjoy thoughtful, relaxing gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/5ae9003ae1761b620794ae0340b4f458.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a charming pirate puzzle adventure where brains matter more than brawn.<br>In this cute Sokoban-style game, your goal is to bury all the treasures on each island using logic, positioning, and a bit of pirate ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/421a59dc31962099b767a19bb3bdcf6b.poster.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/421a59dc31962099b767a19bb3bdcf6b.webm?t=1783601946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/421a59dc31962099b767a19bb3bdcf6b.mp4?t=1783601946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>40 paradise islands</strong>, you’ll push, destroy, sink, and bury objects to solve increasingly clever puzzles. Each island introduces new spatial challenges, mechanics, and terrain interactions that put your planning skills and creativity to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can interact with a variety of objects to solve each puzzle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push <strong>boxes, treasure chests, totems, snowmen, and cannons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy boxes</strong> by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing them into the water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pushing them against sharp rocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blowing them up with cannons</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/5dd34061d770a0cd5d4f3a6d348ad834.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy totems, snowmen, and cannons</strong> by dropping them into the water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place <strong>boxes into pits</strong> to create walkable paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk freely across <strong>bridges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage <strong>fragile bridges</strong>, which can only support limited movement<br>(Dragging boxes across them also consumes durability)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/1bcfb010e13e22fe66ea1d33582076ce.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environments &amp; Terrain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island is built using different terrain types that affect movement and strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sand</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grass</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/0a500efc2237ca7bd71cc19e50d1287b.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice</strong> – where objects slide until they hit something, adding an extra layer of challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/ceacb2fea99e3d74bd0f2966f13eb730.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pirate-themed Sokoban puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique islands to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple interactive objects with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental mechanics that reward careful planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, challenging to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for puzzle lovers who enjoy thoughtful, relaxing gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365920/extras/5ae9003ae1761b620794ae0340b4f458.avif?t=1783601946\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "In this cute sokoban-style game, your goal is to bury all the treasures on each island using logic, positioning, and a bit of pirate ingenuity. Across 40 paradise islands, you’ll shoot cannons, and push, destroy, sink, and bury objects to solve increasingly clever puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "